  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/653/653-2.htm",
  "statuteText": "653:2 Electors of the President and Vice-President. –\n\nAt the state general election in 1980 and at the state general election every fourth year thereafter, the voters of the state shall elect the number of electors of the president and vice-president of the United States to which the state is entitled."
